Simplified Java (s-Java) Verifier (EX5)

A two-pass syntax, scope, and semantic verifier for s-Java source files
using Java regular expressions and structured validation components.

Main Regexes:
- Method declaration regex: matches void method signatures, valid method
  names, optional parameter lists, and opening braces '{' with optional
  surrounding whitespace.
- Variable declaration regex: matches optional 'final', valid s-Java types,
  variable names, optional initializations, comma-separated declarations,
  and trailing ';'.

Design & Modules:
- main / Sjavac: CLI argument entry point, execution flow, and exit codes
  (0 valid, 1 syntax/semantic error, 2 I/O error).
- Verifier: coordinates two-pass scanning (method collection and full validation).
- Scope & VarInfo: manage nested scopes, variable visibility, and state.
- MethodTable, AssignmentValidator, ConditionValidator, LiteralUtils,
  TypeUtils: handle method registration and type/expression validation.
